WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Open a PDF from Kept and edit supported text in place.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Move and restyle text while preserving the document workflow.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Add an image and place it directly on the page.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Draw a signature once, then reuse it in the document.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Rotate, reorder, or remove pages in the same editor.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Export the edited PDF and continue sharing.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Kept also edits copied screenshots, images, and videos.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:46.200
Copy, edit, and paste without leaving your workflow.
